      "text": "starting_point          input\ngoal · org_types · countries · queries   ← interpret_start\nqueue[PageTask] · current · page          ← explore loop\nclassification · listings                 ← classify / find_calendar\nleads[Lead] · sources[SourceIn]           ← extract_leads / add_org_lead\nmissing[Lead]                             ← check_known\ncandidates: Annotated[list, operator.add] ← research_org (reducer)\nfinal_candidates                          ← dedupe_candidates\n\nResearchState: goal · lead · website_url · resolve_hits ·\n  pages · extraction · already_known · candidates (+reducer)\nResearchOutput: candidates only (merged into parent)",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "starting_point          input\ngoal · org_types · countries · queries   ← interpret_start\nqueue[PageTask] · current · page          ← explore loop\nclassification · listings                 ← classify / find_calendar\nleads[Lead] · sources[SourceIn]           ← extract_leads / add_org_lead\nmissing[Lead]                             ← check_known\ncandidates: Annotated[list, operator.add] ← research_org (reducer)\nfinal_candidates                          ← dedupe_candidates\n\nResearchState: goal · lead · website_url · resolve_hits ·\n  pages · extraction · already_known · candidates (+reducer)\nResearchOutput: candidates only (merged into parent)",
